---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.ts';
---
<Base title="About" path="/about" description="Why Henneth exists: honest, plain-English research for Pakistan's markets — accountable by design.">
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>Honest research for Pakistan's markets</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Around half a million Pakistanis invest on the PSX. Almost none of them have a research tool
        that speaks plainly, shows its working, and admits when it is wrong. {site.name} is built to
        be that tool.
      </p>

      <h2>The problem we started with</h2>
      <p>Research in this market comes in two flavours: raw numbers with no explanation, or confident calls with no accountability. Beginners drown in the first and get burned by the second. We wanted something a first-time investor could actually understand, and a serious one could actually check.</p>

      <h2>How we are different</h2>
      <p>Three commitments run through everything. We <b>explain</b> — every stock gets a plain-English read. We <b>debate</b> — analysts argue each name out in the open, bull against bear. And we <b>keep score</b> — every read is dated and graded over time, losses included, with the same yardstick turned on the brokers.</p>

      <h2>What we will never do</h2>
      <p>{site.name} is a research and analytics tool, not an adviser and not a broker. It never places orders. It never says buy. It never promises returns. The decision is always yours — our job is to make it a well-informed one.</p>

      <div class="ab-cta">
        <a href="/plans" class="btn btn-solid">Get started</a>
        <a href="/research" class="btn">How the desk reasons</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 14px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .prose p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .prose .lead { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .ab-cta { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
